  (text "WHEEL-LOCAL ACT_5V ENERGY STORAGE\nKeep these parts on the wheel board after depanelization. No main-board capacitance credit."
    (at 25 20 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.2 1.2))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "547b803c-7bfc-5f56-98a2-4c61101e7edf"))
  (text "C90: positive pad 1 to ACT_5V.\nPlace beside U21 VM ceramics and brake power return.\nRetain C44/C45/C68/C69 and local 100nF bypasses.\nWheel total: 140.4uF nominal; 47uF effective minimum.\nAllow 6.0mm component height plus mechanical margin."
    (at 35 110 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.2 1.2))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "a9a3fe40-4821-5906-a940-382367c63654"))
  (text "D6: cathode pad 1 to ACT_5V.\nShort, wide return to local power GND.\nNOT a 6.5V clamp or a continuous braking load.\nU30/U31/Q5/R121-R124 remain the primary brake."
    (at 35 150 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.2 1.2))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "2e2cae73-c030-58c0-a01d-80907c0d88c4"))
  (text "R146 works with the power cable absent.\nAbout 1.69s from 6.5V to 0.5V at nominal C/R,\nonly with no external supply or motor generation.\nCheck actual rail voltage before servicing."
    (at 225 110 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.2 1.2))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "2bcda1f0-54dc-54cb-b8da-23a0bf711aec"))
  (text "DRAFT: capacitor ESR/effective C, inrush, brake transient, harness return faults and PCB layout remain unqualified.\nNo live cable mating. See ../LOCAL_POWER_REVIEW.md and ../INTERFACE_REVIEW.md."
    (at 35 195 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.2 1.2))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "f04c2581-5163-5873-bf3e-40d159124217")))
